{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057670/extras/67c409cad1e7dc518676b7d3c59cb7e2.poster.avif?t=1769273292\" width=1024 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057670/extras/67c409cad1e7dc518676b7d3c59cb7e2.webm?t=1769273292\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057670/extras/67c409cad1e7dc518676b7d3c59cb7e2.mp4?t=1769273292\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Midnighters</strong> is a survival horror game for 1-4 players where you hunt for cursed treasures. Dark caves, abandoned tombs, and ominous mines await you. However, these treasures are no ordinary riches; each is hidden in the shadow of terrifying creatures and demonic entities.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>IN PURSUIT OF CURSED TREASURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your detector to find buried gold and valuable items, dig them up, and bring the loot to the surface. Then sell your fortune to buy new treasure maps and unlock increasingly dangerous areas. But beware: each level features ghosts and spirits with unique abilities waiting for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057670/extras/ffc3575840b879799b1ef652f4157a03.poster.avif?t=1769273292\" width=1024 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057670/extras/ffc3575840b879799b1ef652f4157a03.webm?t=1769273292\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057670/extras/ffc3575840b879799b1ef652f4157a03.mp4?t=1769273292\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>YOUR EYES CAN DECEIVE YOU</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You cannot trust your eyes. Hallucinations may turn you against your friends, and the whispers you hear may confuse your mind. When one of your team falls, you can revive them and stand together against fear through solidarity. But if you don't act in time, the curse will fall upon all of you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The night grows deeper. Gather the treasures, confront your fears, and survive as The Midnighters team\u2026 or fade into the darkness.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057670/extras/6812490de81f7f642442e0bc9afa07dc.poster.avif?t=1769273292\" width=1024 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057670/extras/6812490de81f7f642442e0bc9afa07dc.webm?t=1769273292\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057670/extras/6812490de81f7f642442e0bc9afa07dc.mp4?t=1769273292\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DOES THE DARKNESS SCARES YOU?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1-4 Player Co-Op:</strong> Team up with friends to hunt down fear and cursed treasures\u2014survival is impossible alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Treasure and Progression System:</strong> Earn money by selling the treasures you find, unlock new treasure maps and darker areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Detector and Digging Mechanics:</strong> Detect buried gold and valuable items, dig up the ground and bring the riches to light.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hallucinations:</strong> Your eyes and mind may deceive you; you may mistake your friend for an enemy or fall prey to demonic whispers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Horror:</strong> Experience peak tension with realistic sounds, dark environments, and a constant sense of being followed.1-4 Player Co-Op: Team up with friends to hunt down fear and cursed treasures\u2014survival is impossible alone.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4057670?t=1769273292","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057670/7b8d57958dbc7eb5eb6b54e554640c067a259bab/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769273292","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057670/92acb5983e383884484603c0629192e7b958a330/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769273292","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057670/92acb5983e383884484603c0629192e7b958a330/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769273292","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"There are bloody locations and scary content in the game."},"demos":[{"appid":4326250,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057670/extras/67c409cad1e7dc518676b7d3c59cb7e2.poster.avif?t=1769273292\" width=1024 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057670/extras/67